                  1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in
                  6.0pt;margin-left:4.8pt;margin-right:0in">
                  <div>
                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><span
                        style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">This
                        is the working group last call for the "TLS 1.3
                        Extension for Certificate-based Authentication
                        with an External Pre-Shared Key” draft available
                        at <a
href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-tls-tls13-cert-with-extern-psk/"
                          target="_blank" moz-do-not-send="true">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-tls-tls13-cert-with-extern-psk/</a>.
                        Please review the document and send your
                        comments to the list by 2359 UTC on 23 April
                        2019.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
                    <div>
                      <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><o:p> </o:p></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Thanks,<br>
                          Chris, Joe, and Sean</span><o:p></o:p></p>
